TIMetaTemplate.displayName.WarForOurWorldScenario=War for our World
TIMetaTemplate.description.WarForOurWorldScenario=The aliens reach Earth on 1 January 1898. Colonial empires rule the planet, there is no spaceflight, no nuclear weapons and a world economy at two percent of its present size.<br/><h>No tutorial. Very high difficulty.</h>
